# Bypass tunnel portal (back layer, no outlines): an arch ring i/m with a
# d reveal round the transparent mouth (x 0..15, rows 16..47 + the pointed
# top), the only light pixels; a wing wall m with d joints and a 1 px d
# coping, its top 10 px below the terrace top at x 16 falling to the road
# at x 63 (no grass, no light top: never a ramp, D-038); a g/G tuft
# hanging from the terrace lip at x 16..21, rows 0..3; a d/m footing.
# Place it at col 105 with
# dx 8 (left edge = col 104): x 0..15 lies under the Alm's meadow and
# tunnel_bg tiles (the mouth), so the jamb and the slope show in cols
# 105..107. The slope is never flush with the terrace (D-038).
sprite = tunnelportal
size   = 64x48
origin = 32,48
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
